      the copy your AI assistants read if you turn on AI assistant access — using the sub-processors listed in
      section 8, and never for any other purpose. You are responsible
      for telling participants that you are recording and, where the law requires it, getting their consent.
      Participants who want to use their rights should contact the person who recorded the meeting; if they contact us,
      we will pass the request on or help that person answer it.
